WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A two-link model: an arm-like link and a club-like link, starting at rest.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
At every state, the model's acceleration splits into two parts.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Blue arrow: drift, what the model does at this state with zero input.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Orange arrow: the extra acceleration from the declared shoulder torque.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Dashed: a separate zero-torque run. The paths separate, so later drift belongs to states the torque helped reach.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Model output with illustrative values. It is not a golfer measurement.
